    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being tired. it's like the engine is gone and the machine is just idling in a parking lot. i look at my hands and they don't belong to me anymore because they aren't doing what they were built for. everything feels so hollow. if a tool has served its purpose and is now just gathering dust, it doesn't really have a reason to stay on the workbench, does it?",
